{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12211170","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12211170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1221116001:":{"text":"어라? 우와~ 너무 예쁘다!","source_cn":"咦？好漂亮的鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD237F994AAAA47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1221116002:":{"text":"설마… 무지개 도미?","source_cn":"难道是……幻彩鲷？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE3AAF2745AF994D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1221116003:":{"text":"엄마, 엄마! 이것 좀 봐요!","source_cn":"妈妈，妈妈，你快来看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF00E08F44398F1D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221117001:1":{"text":"엄마, 이것 봐요! 예쁜 물고기가 있어요!","source_cn":"妈妈，你看——！好漂亮的鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFBB24BBA7AEEEEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221117002:1":{"text":"이, 이건… 무지개 도미이지 않더냐? 섬에서만 볼 수 있는 물고기인데, 어떻게 여기에 나타난 걸까?","source_cn":"这……这是是幻彩鲷？！可这种鱼应该只有海岛上才有，怎么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1875D87B8628091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221117003:1":{"text":"…바다가 제 소원을 들어준 게 분명해요!","source_cn":"——是大海实现了我的愿望！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A9CB4E169C0B52D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221117004:1":{"text":"…바다?","source_cn":"……大海？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98FCDF3B3CFA5F2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221117005:1":{"text":"네! 아빠가 그랬는데, 엄마 말 잘 듣고 착하게 있으면 바다가 제 소원을 들어줄 거라고 했어요.","source_cn":"嗯！爸爸说过，只要我乖乖听话，不给你添麻烦，大海就会实...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB187068D8256D71A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221117006:1":{"text":"요즘 엄마가 한숨만 쉬고 있어서 몰래 바다에 소원편지를 써서 무지개 도미를 보내달라고 했거든요. 아빠가 그랬는데, 엄마한테 청혼할 때 준비했던 선물이라고 했거든요.","source_cn":"妈妈最近总是叹气，所以我偷偷写了一封许愿信，希望大海能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF1C36D4D59D7AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221117007:1":{"text":"엄마, 난 엄마가 즐거웠으면 좋겠어요. 아빠랑 형도 그렇게 생각할 거예요!","source_cn":"妈妈，安尔姆希望你能开心一点，爸爸和哥哥肯定也是这么想的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE3EBBD26B9D2D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221117008:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 아빠랑 형은 최고의 도선사니까, 분명 안전하게 돌아올 거예요!","source_cn":"别担心了，他们可是最厉害的引航员，一定会平安回来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF2E6A1A8FDF08E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1221117009:1":{"text":"그래… 우리 아들, 참 착하구나. 알았으니까, 엄마도… 꼭 기운을 차릴게.","source_cn":"好……乖孩子，不愧是我的小安尔姆。妈妈知道了，妈妈……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x410243720DC3C607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1221117010:1":{"text":"그럼 우리 같이 무지개 도미를 키워볼까? 엄마는 벌써 두 번째 키우는 거란다.","source_cn":"我们去把幻彩鲷养起来吧？这还是妈妈第二次养这种鱼呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2720E7B53DF38BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1221117011:1":{"text":"네! 아빠가 돌아와서 보면 분명 좋아할 거예요!","source_cn":"嗯！等爸爸回来看到了，肯定会很高兴的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BD9578149DB1BB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1221116001:":{"text":"어라? 우와~ 너무 예쁘다!","source_cn":"咦？好漂亮的鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD237F994AAAA47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1221116002:":{"text":"설마… 무지개 도미?","source_cn":"难道是……幻彩鲷？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE3AAF2745AF994D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:18:1221116003:":{"text":"엄마, 엄마! 이것 좀 봐요!","source_cn":"妈妈，妈妈，你快来看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF00E08F44398F1D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:20:12021134:0":{"text":"우리가 몰래 놓아둔 무지개 도미를 발견한 에이름은 기뻐하며 어머니를 불렀다.","source_cn":"安尔姆发现了你们悄悄放下的幻彩鲷，兴高采烈地呼唤母亲过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA43FE6AF1A9F5AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:21:12021134:0":{"text":"우리가 몰래 놓아둔 무지개 도미를 발견한 에이름은 기뻐하며 어머니를 불렀다.","source_cn":"安尔姆发现了你们悄悄放下的幻彩鲷，兴高采烈地呼唤母亲过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA43FE6AF1A9F5AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:安尔姆":{"text":"에이름","source":"安尔姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:乔瓦娜":{"text":"지오반니","source":"乔瓦娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":28,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":3}}